{"id":72155,"date":"2026-10-31T22:49:56","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T22:49:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72155"},"modified":"2026-11-02T14:06:57","modified_gmt":"2026-11-02T13:06:57","slug":"sao-silvestre-santo-tirso","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-santo-tirso\/","title":{"rendered":"29\u00aa S. Silvestre de Santo Tirso 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">29\u00aa S. Silvestre de Santo Tirso 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>29\u00aa S. Silvestre de Santo Tirso 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada na <strong>Rua do Picoto<\/strong>, junto ao <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo Municipal de Santo Tirso<\/strong> (distrito do Porto). Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Santo Tirso<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong>C.A.S.T. \u2013 Centro de Atletismo de Santo Tirso<\/strong>, esta cl\u00e1ssica noturna nortenha celebra a sua 29\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o unindo competi\u00e7\u00e3o de estrada de alto n\u00edvel, desporto forma\u00e7\u00e3o e uma forte tradi\u00e7\u00e3o gastron\u00f3mica de conv\u00edvio.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa arranca \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> com a <strong>Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria (3,2 km)<\/strong> \u2014 na qual <strong>2,00 \u20ac de cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o revertem a favor de institui\u00e7\u00f5es de solidariedade<\/strong> \u2014 e prossegue entre as <strong>18:05 e as 19:15<\/strong> com as <strong>7 Corridas Jovens gratuitas<\/strong> para escal\u00f5es de Benjamins A e B, Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis (dist\u00e2ncias dos <strong>600 m aos 2600 m<\/strong>). \u00c0s <strong>20:00<\/strong> \u00e9 dado o tiro de partida simult\u00e2neo para a prova rainha da <strong>Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de 10 km<\/strong> (duas voltas de 5000 m, aberta a Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos M\/F 40 a 60+) e para a <strong>Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> (uma volta, classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral absoluta M\/F). Na prova de 10 km est\u00e3o em disputa pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios em <strong>Vale Compras Continente<\/strong> para o Top 10 da geral M\/F (at\u00e9 600 \u20ac para os vencedores), pr\u00e9mios cumulativos por escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio (Top 10 por escal\u00e3o) e um pr\u00e9mio especial de <strong>Meta Volante aos 5000 m<\/strong> (100 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba masculino e 1\u00aa feminina a concluir os 10 km).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Fiel \u00e0 hospitalidade tirsense, o kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o dos 10 km, 5 km e Caminhada inclui <strong>t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal (personalizado para pagamentos at\u00e9 1 de dezembro) e 1 garrafa de Vinho Verde<\/strong>. Na chegada \u00e0 meta, al\u00e9m da medalha oficial nas corridas, todos os participantes t\u00eam direito a uma <strong>caixa com 2 Jesu\u00edtas de Santo Tirso<\/strong> e ao tradicional conv\u00edvio com <strong>sandes de porco no espeto (2 porcos no espeto), cerveja e sumos<\/strong>. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"