 #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03 e 04\/12)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria 3,2 Km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Abastecimento final<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 24\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 7,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25\/10 a 20\/11)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21\/11 a 30\/11)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Local Kits):<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03 e 04\/12)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corridas Jovens \u2014 Benjamins a Juvenis (18:05 \u00e0s 19:15)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:05<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Abastecimento na meta<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a 29\u00aa S. Silvestre de Santo Tirso 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 29\u00aa S. Silvestre de Santo Tirso 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na Rua do Picoto, junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo Municipal de Santo Tirso (distrito do Porto). A Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria parte \u00e0s 18:00, as Corridas Jovens decorrem entre as 18:05 e as 19:15 (Benjamins A \u00e0s 18:05\/18:15, Benjamins B \u00e0s 18:25\/18:35, Infantis \u00e0s 18:45, Iniciados \u00e0s 19:00 e Juvenis \u00e0s 19:15) e as provas de 10 km e 5 km partem \u00e0s 20:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Santo Tirso 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o divididas em tr\u00eas fases online (at\u00e9 24\/10, de 25\/10 a 20\/11 e de 21\/11 a 30\/11) e uma fase de \u00faltima hora no secretariado (03 e 04\/12): Corrida 10 km por 10,00 \u20ac, 12,50 \u20ac, 15,00 \u20ac e 17,50 \u20ac; Corrida 5 km por 8,00 \u20ac, 9,00 \u20ac, 10,00 \u20ac e 12,00 \u20ac; Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria 3,2 km por 5,00 \u20ac, 7,00 \u20ac, 8,00 \u20ac e 10,00 \u20ac (2,00 \u20ac revertem para causa solid\u00e1ria). As Corridas Jovens (Benjamins a Juvenis) t\u00eam inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita at\u00e9 30 de novembro.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e no conv\u00edvio final?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nos 10 km, 5 km e Caminhada, o kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal (personalizado para pagamentos at\u00e9 1 de dezembro) e 1 garrafa de Vinho Verde. Na meta, todos os participantes recebem medalha (nas corridas), uma caixa com 2 Jesu\u00edtas de Santo Tirso e participam no conv\u00edvio tradicional com sandes de porco no espeto (2 porcos no espeto), cerveja e sumos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do kit de atleta realiza-se na Sala de Imprensa do Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo Municipal de Santo Tirso (Rua do Picoto) na quinta-feira e sexta-feira, 3 e 4 de dezembro, das 17:00 \u00e0s 21:00, e no s\u00e1bado (dia da prova), 5 de dezembro, das 13:30 \u00e0s 19:30. No dia da prova n\u00e3o s\u00e3o aceites novas inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios em disputa na prova de 10 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova de 10 km atribui pr\u00e9mios em Vale Compras Continente aos 10 primeiros da geral masculina e feminina (600 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 400 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 300 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba, at\u00e9 25 \u20ac no 10\u00ba lugar), cumulativos com os pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00e3o (Top 10 em Juniores\/Seniores e Veteranos M\/F 40 a 60+, de 70 \u20ac a 15 \u20ac), al\u00e9m de um pr\u00e9mio de Meta Volante aos 5000 m de 100 \u20ac para o 1\u00ba atleta masculino e 1\u00aa feminina que concluam a prova.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"29\u00aa S. Silvestre de Santo Tirso 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Santo Tirso, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santo Tirso\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"29\u00aa S. Silvestre de Santo Tirso 2026 a 5 de dezembro no Porto. Corridas de 10 km e 5 km, Caminhada 3,2 km e Jovens com Jesu\u00edtas e porco no espeto. Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-s-silvestre-de-santo-tirso.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 Km (2 Voltas de 5000 m)\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.queroir.pt\/evento\/29-s-silvestre-de-santo-tirso\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 5 Km (Absolutos M\/F)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"